ittle more colorful?"}} {:id "vocab-5e70b323ad" :track :vocab :level "N1" :display "組み込む" :reading "くみこむ" :romaji "kumikomu" :meanings ["to insert" "to include" "to cut in (printing)"] :meaning "to insert" :example {:ja "モデムはコンピューターの中に組み込まれた。" :furigana "モデムはコンピューターの{中|なか}に{組|く}み{込|こ}まれた。" :en "The modem was built into the computer."}} {:id "vocab-3f68e34ac7" :track :vocab :level "N1" :display "蔵" :reading "くら" :romaji "kura" :meanings ["warehouse" "cellar" "magazine"] :meaning "warehouse" :example {:ja "下戸の建てたる蔵もなし。" :furigana nil :en "Nobody ever got rich by saving on drinks."}} {:id "vocab-7dd1f2e142" :track :vocab :level "N1" :display "ぐらい" :reading "ぐらい" :romaji "gurai" :meanings ["approximately"] :meaning "approximately" :example {:ja "彼は大体あなたぐらいの年齢です。" :furigana "{彼|かれ}は{大体|だいたい}あなたぐらいの{年齢|ねんれい}です。" :en "He is about your age."}} {:id "vocab-74638a00a2" :track :vocab :level "N1" :display "クラブ" :reading "クラブ" :romaji "kurabu" :meanings ["club" "crab"] :meaning "club" :example nil} {:id "vocab-a0ad5884f8" :track :vocab :level "N1" :display "グラフ" :reading "グラフ" :romaji "gurafu" :meanings ["graph"] :meaning "graph" :example {:ja "炭素排出量の変動が、以下のグラフに描かれている。" :furigana nil :en "The differing volumes of carbon emissions are plotted in the graph below."}} {:id "vocab-0e4bfbe5d4" :track :vocab :level "N1" :display "苦しめる" :reading "くるしめる" :romaji "kurushimeru" :meanings ["to torment" "to harass" "to inflict pain"] :meaning "to torment" :example {:ja "その事実が彼女の心を苦しめている。" :furigana nil :en "The matter weighs on her mind."}} {:id "vocab-4e7af4d59e" :track :vocab :level "N1" :display "グレー" :reading "グレー" :romaji "guree" :meanings ["grey" "gray"] :meaning "grey" :example {:ja "私の事務所はあのグレーの６階建てのビルの４階だ。" :furigana nil :en "My office is on the fourth floor of that gray six-story building."}} {:id "vocab-8290ed6e7a" :track :vocab :level "N1" :display "クレーン" :reading "クレーン" :romaji "kureen" :meanings ["crane"] :meaning "crane" :example {:ja "クレーンを操縦するのには、勿論、免許が必要です。" :furigana "クレーン